      ],
      "summary": "Source-bound self-review of src/contracts/context-telemetry.ts, src/services/context-telemetry.ts, the native adapter, and focused tests found no blocking issues. The shared service is registration-free and allowlist-sanitized; the native adapter reads only named supported properties, never enumerates or recursively traverses arbitrary values, caps every collection/text dimension, exposes degraded/unavailable contributor detail, and retains only numeric aggregates/fixed codes. Existing usage, pressure, contributor fields, HUD input, and report modes remain present; contributorDetail is additive. Focused typecheck and 20 tests pass; git diff --check is clean.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "pi-model-self-review",
